flowchart TD
  A[Doctor or Admin sets appointment status to cancelled] --> B[PATCH /api/appointments/:id/status]
  B --> C{Status changed to cancelled?}
  C -->|No| Z[Stop — no waitlist action]
  C -->|Yes| D[notifyWaitlistOnCancel appointment]

  D --> E[Query waitlist status waiting<br/>same department<br/>doctor NULL or matching<br/>preferred_date NULL or matching<br/>ORDER BY created_at ASC]

  E --> F{Candidate rows found?}
  F -->|No| G[Log: no matching waitlist entry]
  G --> Z2[End]

  F -->|Yes| H[Filter by preferred_period<br/>any OR morning/afternoon from slot time]
  H --> I{Match after period filter?}
  I -->|No| G
  I -->|Yes| J[UPDATE waitlist<br/>status notified<br/>store notified_doctor_id date time]

  J --> K[INSERT notifications<br/>channel log + message]
  K --> L[Patient sees Notified on My Waitlist]

  L --> M{Patient action}
  M -->|Book now| N[POST /api/waitlist/:id/convert]
  N --> O{Slot still free?}
  O -->|Yes| P[INSERT appointment pending<br/>waitlist status booked]
  O -->|No| Q[409 Slot already taken]
  M -->|Cancel entry| R[PATCH waitlist status cancelled]
  M -->|Ignores offer| S[Entry remains notified<br/>may later expire or stay until converted]
